  "path_redaction": "Only the absolute workspace prefix in pinned-terms.log changed, in four fields, to <fixture-workspace>. Its source and export hashes are distinct. The other thirteen files are byte-identical to their source commits. The traces are published as recorded: the program_artifacts section of the main, passkey and recoverable traces names the three program binaries by their absolute paths on the machine that ran them.",
  "source_files": "The six files under source/ are the build inputs that differ between the base commit and the program_source commit, copied byte for byte. Their SHA-256 values equal the entries for the same paths in the build_inputs of the main, passkey and recoverable traces. The other 63 build inputs are identical to the files under ../source/. The files retain their existing copyright, and this release adds no license grant for them."
